Hello,

 

OFED-3.12-1-rc3 is now available at:

https://openfabrics.org/downloads/OFED/ofed-3.12-1/OFED-3.12-1-rc3.tgz 

 

To get the BUILD_ID run ofed_info

 

Please report any issues in Bugzilla

http://bugs.openfabrics.org/bugzilla/ for OFED 3.12-1

 

Release notes: 

https://openfabrics.org/downloads/OFED/release_notes/OFED_3.12-1_rc3_release
_notes 

 

 

OFED-3.12-1-rc3 Main Changes from OFED 3.12-1-rc2

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
---

1. Add support for the OSes

   - RedHat EL6.6

2. Updated packages:

    - infinipath-psm-3.3-2

    - mstflint-3.7.1-1.22

3. Intel True Scale HCAs are now supported using OFED 3.12-1 and RHEL 7.0
based OSes

 

Thanks

 

Rupert

--

